Rule 1 (Log1p accepts any-rank tensor; all dimensions are non-negative)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 0 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 2 (Log1p real-domain safety: empty input or all elements greater than -1)
{v_1 : tensor} |= (∃i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = 0) ∨ min(v_1) > -1
